{"4076730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Assault Zeta", "steam_appid": 4076730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Annihilate all Earthling resistance!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your alien space ship in the first wave of the assault on Earth. Your mission is to destroy all trace of human civilization. They are no match for your powerful weapons and shield technology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the unconventional flight mechanics of your craft, as you seamlessly switch from hovering for precise aiming to sweeping across the landscape at high speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Ship </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/649b476b574e74361c949e92436f6480.poster.avif?t=1776675545\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/649b476b574e74361c949e92436f6480.webm?t=1776675545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/649b476b574e74361c949e92436f6480.mp4?t=1776675545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is agile and powerful, but flying it well requires skill and precision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine Lunar Lander, but in 3D. The ship can be tilted forwards or backwards, or turned left or right. Thrust comes from the bottom of your ship, so thrusting while tilting forward not only pushes the ship upwards it also propels it forward. Sometimes at great speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/59747306478306f03e0afabc9b76e011.poster.avif?t=1776675545\" width=200 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/59747306478306f03e0afabc9b76e011.webm?t=1776675545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/59747306478306f03e0afabc9b76e011.mp4?t=1776675545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/8a00f87cbd5214ff01f20213ca602b81.poster.avif?t=1776675545\" width=200 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/8a00f87cbd5214ff01f20213ca602b81.webm?t=1776675545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/8a00f87cbd5214ff01f20213ca602b81.mp4?t=1776675545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is equipped with a powerful beam weapon. It's useful for destroying both enemy structures and the Earthling military.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship can be controlled with either mouse or gamepad. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The primary game mode is <strong>Time Attack</strong>. Destroy all of the Earthling structures is as fast a time as possible. Compare yourself against your friends on the friends leaderboard for each map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave Survival</strong> - Survive against the endless waves of the puny Earthling military.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landing Challenge</strong> - Show off your mastery for flying the alien craft by completing a series of difficult landing challenges.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Annihilate all Earthling resistance!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your alien space ship in the first wave of the assault on Earth. Your mission is to destroy all trace of human civilization. They are no match for your powerful weapons and shield technology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the unconventional flight mechanics of your craft, as you seamlessly switch from hovering for precise aiming to sweeping across the landscape at high speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Ship </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/649b476b574e74361c949e92436f6480.poster.avif?t=1776675545\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/649b476b574e74361c949e92436f6480.webm?t=1776675545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/649b476b574e74361c949e92436f6480.mp4?t=1776675545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is agile and powerful, but flying it well requires skill and precision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine Lunar Lander, but in 3D. The ship can be tilted forwards or backwards, or turned left or right. Thrust comes from the bottom of your ship, so thrusting while tilting forward not only pushes the ship upwards it also propels it forward. Sometimes at great speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/59747306478306f03e0afabc9b76e011.poster.avif?t=1776675545\" width=200 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/59747306478306f03e0afabc9b76e011.webm?t=1776675545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/59747306478306f03e0afabc9b76e011.mp4?t=1776675545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/8a00f87cbd5214ff01f20213ca602b81.poster.avif?t=1776675545\" width=200 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/8a00f87cbd5214ff01f20213ca602b81.webm?t=1776675545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/extras/8a00f87cbd5214ff01f20213ca602b81.mp4?t=1776675545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is equipped with a powerful beam weapon. It's useful for destroying both enemy structures and the Earthling military.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship can be controlled with either mouse or gamepad. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The primary game mode is <strong>Time Attack</strong>. Destroy all of the Earthling structures is as fast a time as possible. Compare yourself against your friends on the friends leaderboard for each map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave Survival</strong> - Survive against the endless waves of the puny Earthling military.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landing Challenge</strong> - Show off your mastery for flying the alien craft by completing a series of difficult landing challenges.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Pilot your alien space ship in an assault to wipe out all Earthling civilization. They're no match for your technology, but they won't go down without a fight. ASSAULT ZETA is an old-school, UFO-flight simulator. Master the unconventional alien spaceship and unleash destruction on the resistance!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/6f5522435275c3658b7a7811215d885062db67c8/header.jpg?t=1776675545", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/2d1dddcb5627c666486484a49b9a1dcc9a37dd7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776675545", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076730/2d1dddcb5627c666486484a49b9a1dcc9a37dd7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776675545", "website": "https://katapultridge.com/assaultzeta", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel® Core™ i5-2500K / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 960 2GB / AMD Radeon R9 280 3GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requiremen